                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Baggit's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>35+ years of vegan positioning + physical retail scale + founder-led brand storytelling. Value + values + retail infrastructure.</p>
                                        <h3>Baggit vs Zouk?</h3>
                                        <p>Baggit legacy vegan handbags with retail heritage. Zouk newer ethnic-inspired vegan handbags with digital-first. Different segments; overlapping vegan positioning.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new affordable handbag brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in category niching (luxury vegan, athletic, sustainable premium, ethnic-specific). Baggit dominates affordable mainstream vegan.</p>
                                        <h3>How does Baggit compete with Charles &amp; Keith / Aldo?</h3>
                                        <p>Positions differently — Baggit affordable + vegan + Indian; C&K + Aldo aspirational Western. Coexist without direct competition.</p>
